## Next Steps for Deployment

To enable analytics data collection on Vercel:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel: `vercel deploy`
2. Navigate to your project's Analytics section in the Vercel dashboard
3. Click the "Enable" button to activate Web Analytics
4. After deployment, verify tracking by checking the browser's Network tab for requests to `/<unique-path>/view`
5. Analytics data will appear in the Vercel dashboard once users visit the site

